ntities independently corroborate both restarts. The only material quality issue is retained temporary installation and test residue.","limitations":["Native package-health observations timed out before preparation, after preparation, and after execution, so package-manager consistency could not be independently assessed.","The concurrency-time socket-count subcheck in cmd-076a17ec6fb04d1d could not run because ss was unavailable in that command context, and its pgrep count included the inspection shell. The explicit twelve handler PID entries, xinetd START/EXIT logs, client results, and exact final process checks nevertheless provide coherent direct evidence."]}
